1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,270
This old watch

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,510
can turn back time.

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,730
One turn…

4
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:06,870
and your biggest regret

5
00:00:06,919 --> 00:00:08,549
never happened.

6
00:00:09,099 --> 00:00:10,629
The words you said.

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,449
The chance you missed.

8
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:13,570
Gone.

9
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:14,929
But everything

10
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,489
it taught you…

11
00:00:16,539 --> 00:00:17,990
would be gone too.

12
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,329
Maybe that pain

13
00:00:19,379 --> 00:00:20,329
is part of

14
00:00:20,379 --> 00:00:21,690
who you are now.

15
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,489
Or maybe you deserve

16
00:00:23,539 --> 00:00:25,370
a life without it.

17
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:28,629
So…

18
00:00:28,679 --> 00:00:30,260
would you turn it?

